  {"comment": "Rib Direction Normal to Curves (mitcad#2398, GitHub mitcad/Mitcad#651): a 150 x 150 plate from z = -10 to -1 (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2, Body1) with two walls 10 x 150 on it from z = -5 to 10, at x = -20..-10 (Sketch2 F3, Extrude2 F4) and x = 120..130 (Sketch3 F5, Extrude3 F6): 202500 + 2 * 16500 mm3."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [-20, -50], "width": 150, "height": 150},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
